     <div class=\\\"mt-10\\\">\\n                <a href=\\\"#\\\" class=\\\"px-8 py-3 border border-transparent text-base font-medium rounded-md text-indigo-700 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100 md:py-4 md:text-lg md:px-10\\\">\\n                    Get Started\\n                </a>\\n            </div>\\n        </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    \\n</body>\\n</html>\" }} />\n  );\n}\n",
